title: Digital PCR Calculator
abstract: >-
  Digital PCR calculator for ddPCR and dPCR data: copies per µL of your original sample from positive and accepted partition counts, and a vg/mL or GC/mL titer in titer mode, for data from droplet and chamber-based digital PCR instruments, using the partition volume you declare. It shows its working.
